    <title>Riverbend Yoga Studio | Home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Riverbend Yoga Studio</h1>
    <p>Find balance, strength, and peace.</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="services.html">Services</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a href="events.html">Events</a>
</nav>

<main>
    <section>
        <h2>Welcome to Riverbend Yoga Studio</h2>
        <p>Welcome to Riverbend Yoga Studio! We offer a friendly and relaxing space where people can improve their health, build strength, and find peace through yoga. Our classes are open to beginners and experienced students.</p>

        <img src="images/yoga-studio.jpg" alt="Peaceful yoga studio with space for students to practice">

        <h2>Discover the Benefits of Yoga</h2>
        <p>Yoga can help improve flexibility, balance, strength, and relaxation. Our goal is to help every visitor feel comfortable and supported during their practice.</p>

        <picture>
            <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="images/yoga-feature-small.jpg">
            <img src="images/yoga-feature-large.jpg" alt="Yoga practice in a calm and welcoming setting">
        </picture>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Weekly Schedule</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Monday: Beginner Yoga — 9:00 AM</li>
            <li>Tuesday: Vinyasa Yoga — 5:00 PM</li>
            <li>Wednesday: Gentle Yoga — 10:00 AM</li>
            <li>Thursday: Restorative Yoga — 6:00 PM</li>
            <li>Saturday: All Levels Yoga — 11:00 AM</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Relax with a Breathing Exercise</h2>
        <p>Listen to this breathing exercise to help you relax and prepare for your practice.</p>
        <audio controls>
            <source src="images/yoga-breathing.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
            Your browser does not support audio. Please try another browser.
        </audio>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Join Us</h2>
        <p>Visit our Services page to learn about our classes or our Events page to see upcoming workshops.</p>
        <a class="button-link" href="services.html">Explore Our Classes</a>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Riverbend Yoga Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

